WEBVTT

00:07:57.555 --> 00:08:00.583
sem plavala devet ur in 45 minut,

00:08:00.583 --> 00:08:04.362
točno.

00:08:04.362 --> 00:08:08.454
In tu so tudi krize. Seveda so.

00:08:08.454 --> 00:08:10.537
Začne se bruhanje,

00:08:10.537 --> 00:08:12.099
morska voda, slabo ti je,

00:08:12.099 --> 00:08:15.611
nosiš masko proti meduzam
za največjo zaščito.

00:08:15.611 --> 00:08:17.215
Težko se plava v njej.

00:08:17.215 --> 00:08:19.779
Povzroča odrgnine znotraj ust,

00:08:19.779 --> 00:08:22.412
a lovke ne morejo do tebe.

00:08:22.412 --> 00:08:25.092
Pojavi se podhladitev.

00:08:25.092 --> 00:08:28.501
Voda ima 29°C in vseeno izgubljaš težo

00:08:28.501 --> 00:08:31.084
in porabljaš kalorije in ko prideš